    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Candidate Screening Assessment",
        "formDescription": "Welcome to the recruitment screening assessment. Enter your Candidate ID to continue.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Candidate ID",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Which Python features or libraries are you familiar with, and how would you use them to improve backend performance and data processing? Provide an example where possible."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Describe a challenging technical bug or performance bottleneck you encountered and how you diagnosed and resolved it. If you have not encountered one, explain how you would approach troubleshooting it."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Describe your experience with database design, SQL queries and database optimization. If you have limited experience, explain how you would approach these tasks."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "How do your current technical skills align with the requirements of this Python backend developer role? Identify your strongest areas and any skills you would need to improve.  "
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "What experience do you have with Docker or other containerization tools? If you have not used them, explain how you would develop proficiency in Docker."
            },
            {},
            {
              "fieldLabel": "How do you keep your technical knowledge up to date, particularly in Python and database technologies? Share an example of something you recently learned or how you would apply new knowledge."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Backend development often requires cross-functional coordination. Could you share an experience where you collaborated with frontend developers or product managers to define and deliver backend API requirements?"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Imagine you need to design a new Python-based API endpoint that retrieves and filters large datasets from a SQL database. How would you structure the backend logic, handle database queries, and ensure the API remains highly responsive?"
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
