        "subject": "=Recruiter Approval Required — {{ $('Prepare screening answers').item.json.candidateName }} | {{ $('Prepare screening answers').item.json.candidateId }}",
        "message": "=Dear Recruiter,\n\nA candidate has completed the AI-assisted screening assessment for the Python Backend Developer position and has been recommended for human review.\n\nCANDIDATE INFORMATION\n\nCandidate Name: {{ $('Prepare screening answers').item.json.candidateName }}\n\nCandidate ID: {{ $('Prepare screening answers').item.json.candidateId }}\n\nJob Reference: {{ $('Prepare screening answers').item.json.jobId }}\n\nSCREENING EVALUATION\nOverall Score:  {{ $('Update record').item.json.fields[\"Overall Score\"] }}/100\n\nTechnical Score:   {{ $('Update record').item.json.fields[\"Technical Score\"] }} /100\nCommunication Score: {{ $('Update record').item.json.fields[\"Communication Score\"] }}/100\n\nAI Recommendation: {{ $('Update record').item.json.fields[\"Screening Recommendation\"] }}\n\n\nAI Evaluation:\n{{ $('Update record').item.json.fields[\"AI Evaluation\"] }}\n\nACTION REQUIRED\n\nPlease review the candidate's screening performance and determine whether they should proceed to the interview stage.\n\nComplete your review using the secure approval form below:\n\n{{ $execution.resumeFormUrl }}\n\nSelect APPROVED or REJECTED and provide a brief explanation supporting your decision.\n\nYour decision will be recorded in the recruitment system and used to determine the candidate's next stage.\n\nPlease note that the AI screening recommendation is advisory. Final decisions require human judgment.\n\nBest regards,\n\nAI Recruitment Pipeline & Candidate Experience Orchestrator\n\nTechCrush — Group 8\n\nAutomated Notification | Capstone Simulation",
        "options": {}
